19
00:02:18,159 --> 00:02:25,768
[Host] Taking part in a match or event. The first character means to go out, the second means place or arena.

20
00:02:26,367 --> 00:02:32,943
[Slow] 東京の狛江市で、市長を決める選挙がありました。

21
