23
00:02:41,752 --> 00:02:47,439
[Host] An election. It's the word for any vote that chooses a leader or representative.

24
00:02:48,039 --> 00:02:55,407
[Slow] 選挙の結果、松原さんが3回目の当選をしました。

25
00:02:56,207 --> 00:03:01,127
[Host] As a result of the election, Mr. Matsubara won for the third time.

26
00:03:01,728 --> 00:03:03,936
[Vocab] 当選

27
00:03:04,336 --> 00:03:10,048
[Host] Winning an election. The opposite, losing one, uses a different word entirely.

28
00:03:10,647 --> 00:03:18,687
[Slow] 松原さんは、これから4年間、狛江市の市長を続けます。

29
00:03:19,487 --> 00:03:24,623
[Host] Mr. Matsubara will continue as mayor of Komae for the next four years.

30
00:03:25,223 --> 00:03:27,455
